function showIngestPreview(){const s=transient.source;modal('Review knowledge changes',`<div class="flex mb">${tag('1 NEW PAGE','green')}${tag('2 CONNECTIONS','purple')}</div><p>Source: <strong>${esc(s?.title||'Workspace direction.md')}</strong></p><div class="codebox"><span class="success">+ ${esc(s?.title||'Connected workspace direction')}</span>
<span class="success">+ Link: [[Workspace principles]]</span>
<span class="success">+ Link: [[Plugin compatibility notes]]</span>

${esc((s?.body||'A local-first workspace connects meetings, knowledge and explicit plugin capabilities.').slice(0,1400))}</div><div class="notice mt">Keep the original source attached. The proposed page is saved only after your approval. This demo does not run an ingest AI job.</div>`,btn('Keep in queue','close-modal','','ghost')+btn('Approve & save','approve-ingest','check','primary'),true)}
async function copyText(text){try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);toast('Copied to clipboard')}catch{modal('Copy this text',`<textarea readonly style="min-height:200px" aria-label="Text to copy">${esc(text)}</textarea>`,btn('Done','close-modal','check','primary'))}}
function filterMeetings(){const q=$('#meeting-search')?.value.toLowerCase()||'',filter=$('#meeting-filter')?.value||'All meetings';let count=0;$$('[data-meeting]').forEach(el=>{const show=el.dataset.meeting.includes(q)&&(filter==='All meetings'||el.dataset.status===filter);el.classList.toggle('hide',!show);if(show)count++});$('#meeting-empty')?.classList.toggle('hide',count>0)}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const el=e.target.closest('[data-action]');if(el){e.preventDefault();handleAction(el.dataset.action)}if(e.target.classList.contains('modal-overlay'))handleAction('close-modal')});
document.addEventListener('change',e=>{const el=e.target;if(el.dataset.setting){state[el.dataset.setting]=el.checked;save();if(el.dataset.setting==='githubPRs'||el.dataset.setting==='githubCI')toast('Widget preference saved')}if(el.dataset.conversationProfile){state[el.dataset.conversationProfile==='ask'?'askProfile':'chatProfile']=el.value;save();renderPage();toast('Conversation profile selected')}if(el.dataset.preference){state[el.dataset.preference]=el.value;save();renderPage();toast('Preference saved')}if(el.dataset.widget){const id=el.dataset.widget;if((id==='github'&&!pluginEnabled('github'))||(id==='routines'&&!pluginEnabled('scheduler'))||(id==='focus'&&!pluginEnabled('focus-card'))){el.checked=false;toast('Install and enable the contributing plugin first');return}if(el.checked&&!state.widgets.includes(id))state.widgets.push(id);if(!el.checked)state.widgets=state.widgets.filter(x=>x!==id);save();$('#widget-picker').innerHTML=widgetPicker()}if(el.dataset.automationToggle){const a=state.automations.find(x=>x.id===el.dataset.automationToggle);a.enabled=el.checked;save();toast(a.enabled?'Routine enabled':'Routine paused')}if(el.id==='meeting-filter')filterMeetings();if(el.id==='plugin-category'){state.pluginFilter=el.value;save();renderPage()}if(el.id==='ingest-file'||el.id==='transcript-file'){const file=el.files[0];if(!file)return;if(file.size>1024*1024){toast('Use a text file smaller than 1 MB');el.value='';return}file.text().then(text=>{transient.source={title:file.name.replace(/\.[^.]+$/,''),body:text};if(el.id==='transcript-file'){state.recorded=true;state.meetingTab='transcript';save();toast('Transcript read locally. Open the sample meeting to review.')}else showIngestPreview()}).catch(()=>toast('Could not read that file. Try a text file.'))}});
document.addEventListener('input',e=>{const el=e.target;if(el.id==='chat-input'||el.id==='ask-input'){state.drafts={...state.drafts,[el.id.startsWith('ask')?'ask':'chat']:el.value};save()}if(el.id==='palette-search')$('#palette-results').innerHTML=paletteResults(el.value);if(el.id==='meeting-search')filterMeetings();if(el.id==='library-search')$$('[data-library-title]').forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('hide',!n.dataset.libraryTitle.includes(el.value.toLowerCase())));if(el.id==='graph-search')$$('[data-graph-label]').forEach(n=>n.style.opacity=n.dataset.graphLabel.includes(el.value.toLowerCase())?'1':'.15');if(el.id==='knowledge-search'){$$('.tree-item.child').forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('hide',!n.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(el.value.toLowerCase())))}if(el.id==='plugin-search'){state.pluginSearch=el.value;save();const selected=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('tab')||'discover';const filtered=pluginCatalog.filter(p=>(selected!=='installed'||pluginInstalled(p.id))&&(state.pluginFilter==='all'||p.category===state.pluginFilter)&&(p.name+' '+p.summary).toLowerCase().includes(el.value.toLowerCase()));$('#plugin-grid').innerHTML=filtered.length?filtered.map(pluginCard).join(''):`<div class="panel" style="grid-column:1/-1">${empty('No matching plugins','Try another name or category.',btn('Clear filters','clear-plugin-search','refresh'),'search')}</div>`}if((el.id==='chat-input'||el.id==='ask-input')&&el.value==='/'){const kind=el.id.startsWith('ask')?'ask':'chat';const box=$('#'+kind+'-skills');box.classList.remove('hide');box.innerHTML=`<div class="flex wrap" style="padding:7px 0 12px">${['/personal-twin','/meeting-prep','/summarize'].map(s=>`<button class="chip" data-action="inline-skill:${kind}:${s}">${s}</button>`).join('')}</div>`}else if(el.id==='chat-input'||el.id==='ask-input')$('#'+(el.id.startsWith('ask')?'ask':'chat')+'-skills')?.classList.add('hide')});
// Inline skills preserve the draft and insert an exact catalog entry.
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const el=e.target.closest('[data-action^="inline-skill:"]');if(!el)return;const [,kind,skill]=el.dataset.action.split(':');state.skill=skill;save();const input=$('#'+kind+'-input');input.value='';state.drafts={...state.drafts,[kind]:''};save();$('#'+kind+'-skills').classList.add('hide');input.focus();toast('Skill selected: '+skill)});
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if((e.metaKey||e.ctrlKey)&&e.key.toLowerCase()==='k'){e.preventDefault();showPalette()}if(e.key==='Escape'){handleAction('close-modal');$('.sidebar')?.classList.remove('open')}const dialog=$('[role=dialog]');if(e.key==='Tab'&&dialog){const focusables=$$('button,a,input,select,textarea,[tabindex="0"]',dialog).filter(x=>!x.disabled&&!x.classList.contains('screen-reader'));const first=focusables[0],last=focusables.at(-1);if(e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===first){e.preventDefault();last?.focus()}else if(!e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===last){e.preventDefault();first?.focus()}}if(e.key==='Enter'&&e.target.matches('[data-graph-label]'))handleAction(e.target.dataset.action);if((e.metaKey||e.ctrlKey)&&e.key==='Enter'){if(e.target.id==='chat-input')sendChat('chat');if(e.target.id==='ask-input')sendChat('ask')}});
window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{if(page==='settings-setup'){transient.setupTab=location.hash.slice(1)||'installation';renderPage()}if(page==='plugin'){transient.pluginTab=['overview','settings','permissions','compatibility'].includes(location.hash.slice(1))?location.hash.slice(1):'overview';renderPage()}});
matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').addEventListener('change',()=>{if(state.theme==='system')applyTheme()});
if(page==='meeting'&&new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('tab')==='transcript')state.meetingTab='transcript';
function showRecipeEditor(id){const r=recipeList().find(x=>x.id===id)||{name:'',desc:'',prompt:'',template:'# Summary\n\n# Decisions\n\n# Actions',profile:state.mode==='direct'?'Direct Claude Code':'CodeMie · Personal project',timing:'After the meeting'};transient.recipeId=id;modal(id==='new'?'Create a meeting recipe':'Edit '+esc(r.name),`${field('Name','recipe-name',r.name)}${field('Description','recipe-description',r.desc)}<label class="field"><span>Prompt or skill instructions</span><textarea id="recipe-prompt">${esc(r.prompt)}</textarea></label><label class="field"><span>Output template · Markdown or your HTML outline</span><textarea id="recipe-template">${esc(r.template)}</textarea></label><div class="grid2">${selectField('AI profile','recipe-profile',['Direct Claude Code','CodeMie · Personal project'],r.profile)}${selectField('Generate','recipe-timing',['After the meeting','After review','Manually'],r.timing)}</div><div class="notice">Generating minutes does not publish, send or save them into Knowledge. Those remain separate reviewed actions.</div>`,btn('Cancel','close-modal','','ghost')+btn('Save recipe','save-recipe','check','primary'),true)}
document.addEventListener('input',e=>{if(e.target.id==='people-search')$$('[data-person-name]').forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('hide',!n.dataset.personName.includes(e.target.value.toLowerCase())));if(e.target.id==='files-search')$$('[data-file-name]').forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('hide',!n.dataset.fileName.includes(e.target.value.toLowerCase())))});
